         DataFusion Physical Plan: 
           : SortExec: TopK(fetch=3), expr=[agg_0@1 DESC, researcher_id@0 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[false]
           :   AggregateExec: mode=Single, gby=[researcher_id@0 as researcher_id], aggr=[count(1) as agg_0]
           :     HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(researcher_id@0, researcher_id@0)], filter=__w_0_tag_0@0 OR __r_1_tag_0@1, projection=[researcher_id@2]
           :       CooperativeExec
           :         PgSearchScan: table=r, segments=2, visibility=eager, tag_0={"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"bio","query_string":"cancer","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
           :       CooperativeExec
           :         PgSearchScan: table=w, segments=2, dynamic_filters=1, visibility=eager, tag_0={"with_index":{"query":{"parse_with_field":{"field":"abstract_text","query_string":"cancer","lenient":null,"conjunction_mode":null}}}}
